{"src":"en","tgt":"sw","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"sw","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7945.456225000001,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8944.242522,"text":"Hata hivyo, kanda ya Shenzhen inafanya kazi kama nchi moja kwa kiasi fulani katika suala hili."},{"kind":"audio","t":9081.243116000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9086.045440999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":9091.273358999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9096.730613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9097.275604999999,"samples":3510,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":15109.448,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":15995.6784,"text":"Ikiwa juu ya moja ya milima kaskazini mwa Mecca, pango hilo liko karibu"},{"kind":"audio","t":16089.648288,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16094.930645,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16100.429239000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16102.91376,"samples":18445,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":17741.934159,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18308.542295,"text":"mbali na sehemu nyingine ya ulimwengu."},{"kind":"audio","t":18361.543094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18365.054149,"samples":22959,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"input","t":26292.434578,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27564.211249,"text":"Watu sasa huandika ujumbe kwenye vioo vya kompyuta bila kuhitaji kusogea karibu na kinachonoa penseli."},{"kind":"audio","t":27684.994647,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":27689.949289,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27695.285796,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27700.785470000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27704.638439000002,"samples":25523,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"input","t":37525.151726000004,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":39368.440976,"text":"Wasafiri wanaoelekea nchi zenye kodi kubwa wakati mwingine wanaweza kuokoa kiasi kikubwa cha fedha, hasa kwenye bidhaa kama vile vinyago vya kileo na tumbaku."},{"kind":"audio","t":39540.688148,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39545.763899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39551.051166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39556.422802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39561.786768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39567.185843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39568.776318000004,"samples":12371,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":45787.882452,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46574.59078,"text":"Mimea hutengeneza chakula chake kutoka kwa jua kupitia usanisinuru. Pia hutoa kivuli."},{"kind":"audio","t":46679.245881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":46684.365601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":46688.023844,"samples":23907,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":46692.614162,"samples":27585,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1010},{"kind":"input","t":58075.358158,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59767.89708,"text":"Hospitali imefuata itifaki ya kudhibiti maambukizi, ikiwa ni pamoja na kumtenga mgonjwa na wengine ili kuzuia uwezekano wa kuwaambukiza wengine."},{"kind":"audio","t":59914.698068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59919.840757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59924.991495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59930.31295,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":59935.602976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59940.576667,"samples":30928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"input","t":68180.614149,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69521.13685,"text":"Kazi iliyofanyika ilikuwa ya kinadharia zaidi, lakini programu iliandikwa ili kuiga uchunguzi uliofanyika wa galaksi ya Sagittarius."},{"kind":"audio","t":69661.58055,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":69666.384673,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":69671.770198,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69676.836767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69682.263521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69685.50383999999,"samples":20897,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":78312.19984999999,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":79775.60469,"text":"Lugha rasmi za Barcelona ni Kikatalani na Kihispania. Karibu nusu wanapendelea kuzungumza Kikatalani, wengi wao sana kinawaelewa, na karibu kila mtu anajua Kihispania."},{"kind":"audio","t":79869.115635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79874.263283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79875.87444799999,"samples":13318,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"audio","t":79935.663798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79940.87183599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":79946.141702,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79951.607865,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79956.541787,"samples":30817,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"input","t":83784.443187,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":85038.18127599999,"text":"Katika baadhi ya maeneo, kuchemsha maji kwa dakika moja inatosha na katika maeneo mengine dakika kadhaa zinahitajika."},{"kind":"audio","t":85157.806426,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":85162.953195,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85168.28658,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85173.56637599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85177.06585099999,"samples":22736,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"input","t":89856.33602999999,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":91090.85658499999,"text":"Mimea huonekana vizuri zaidi ikiwa katika mazingira ya asili, hivyo epuka tamaa ya kuondoa hata shina moja tu."},{"kind":"audio","t":91213.44301799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91214.818206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91216.63062699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91218.037835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91219.220366,"samples":28866,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"input","t":97274.198828,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98761.106175,"text":"Wakati wa miaka ya 1920, mitazamo iliyotawala kwa wananchi na mataifa mengi ilikuwa ya upacifisti na kujitenga."},{"kind":"audio","t":98910.322045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98915.31195599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98920.760879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98926.039635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98931.327771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98936.39222099999,"samples":30371,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"input","t":103530.35328499999,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104694.812952,"text":"Masa Serif alikuwa mwindaji mkuu wa wakati wake, hivyo hakumwogopa yeyote isipokuwa Mosul wengine."},{"kind":"audio","t":104809.89416499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104815.001964,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":104820.40179799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104825.65759399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104827.56247399999,"samples":14377,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":113140.260801,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114793.877881,"text":"Tangu kuanzishwa kwa Asuncion mnamo 1537, Paraguay imefanikiwa kuhifadhi sehemu kubwa ya asili na utambulisho wake wa kienyeji."},{"kind":"audio","t":114945.285336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114950.451064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114955.75352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":114961.07005499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":114966.419151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114971.738816,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114972.395016,"samples":8470,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":119868.870885,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120859.158289,"text":"Ugonjwa huu unabebwa na nguruwe, ambao kisha huhamia kwa binadamu kupitia mbu."},{"kind":"audio","t":120950.58708699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120955.67225599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120961.07432999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120962.43219899999,"samples":12315,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":129359.89912999999,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130632.65938699999,"text":"Teleskopi nyingi za utafiti za kisasa ni vifaa vikubwa vilivyoko katika maeneo ya mbali yenye hali nzuri ya anga."},{"kind":"audio","t":130738.66143399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130743.877611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130749.158437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130754.49703299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130754.91702599998,"samples":5461,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":135223.434542,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":136145.678896,"text":"Watu wanaweza wasitarajie kwamba uvumilivu na uelewa pia ni muhimu kwa wasafiri"},{"kind":"audio","t":136248.373945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136253.604602,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136258.906908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136264.297592,"samples":32656,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"input","t":140539.733955,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141314.55333,"text":"Hivyo kuna uwezekano kwamba alama hiyo iliwekwa kama lebo tu."},{"kind":"audio","t":141400.695572,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141405.50498599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141410.926869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141411.38702199998,"samples":5628,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":147770.697051,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148546.374513,"text":"Lakini kuna mambo mengi kuhusu ndege ambayo bado yanafanana na dinosaur."},{"kind":"audio","t":148643.75743599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148648.933934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148654.577724,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148658.437653,"samples":25969,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"input","t":154957.031946,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":156115.14983399998,"text":"Karibu zote ni fukwe za mchanga zenye uogeleaji salama na nyingi zina kivuli kinachotolewa na"},{"kind":"audio","t":156224.037725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156229.183233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156234.558298,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156241.54403699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156244.45296,"samples":19950,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":157898.286516,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158185.215589,"text":"miti ya Pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":158216.294116,"samples":27027,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":990},{"kind":"input","t":164346.012841,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165860.765075,"text":"Duvall, ambaye ameolewa na ana watoto wawili watu wazima, hakuacha alama kubwa kwa Miller, ambaye ndiye aliyeambiwa hadithi hiyo."},{"kind":"audio","t":165991.09385499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165996.200744,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166001.56878899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166006.780006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":166011.93888499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166013.95416199998,"samples":14489,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"close","t":176105.43987099998,"code":1005}]}